nc. was founded in 1976 and is based in Las Vegas, Nevada.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Frank J. Fertitta III | Chairman & CEO | Age 63 | Compensation: $3.6M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 9K people. Revenue per employee of $212K ranks in the bottom quartile among Consumer Cyclical peers. Each employee generates $31K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $3K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 17\u00d7 revenue per employee (reasonable relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags elevated compensation governance risk (9/10).","financial_summary":["Red Rock Resorts, Inc. is a mid-cap consumer cyclical business with a $4.9B market cap on $2.0B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +7% over the past three years, a respectable pace for a business of this size.","Returns on capital run at 15% against a 8% cost of capital, a 7-point spread that creates value, though narrow enough that competitive pressure could close it.","The business throws off $291M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 14 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, and cash conversion sits at 3.24\u00d7 so those profits are backed by real cash.","Accruals are elevated at -10.1% of assets, and Sloan showed firms building earnings through accruals rather than cash systematically underperform.","On the balance sheet, debt is heavy at 4.1\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, and leverage like that is what turns a bad year into a permanent loss, and thin 3.0\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Shareholder yield of 4.0% reflects a genuine commitment to returning capital rather than empire-building, and insiders hold 9.6% of the shares, and within its sector the business captures 3.6\u00d7 its fair share of profits, a structural advantage visible in the numbers."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (1.8) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Elevated short interest (14.1% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting the other way","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Insiders are net sellers (100% sell ratio, net $3.0M) \u2014 the people closest to the business are reducing their personal stake","sev":"amber","cat":"insider"},{"text":"Cyclical sectors like Consumer Cyclical tend to underperform in slowdowns","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Consumer staples outperforming discretionary, signaling cautious spending","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Above-average market volatility (VIX 26)","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Late-cycle dynamics increase the probability of a slowdown","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Consumer demand is fundamentally cyclical \u2014 a recession compresses both unit volume and pricing power, and operating leverage cuts both ways.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Brand relevance decay \u2014 shifting consumer preferences and social-media-driven trends can strand inventory and invalidate positioning faster than product cycles can adapt.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Operating margins 22% above sector median \u2014 the quantitative trace of pricing power","Trading at a 43% margin of safety to estimated fair value \u2014 a real cushion against errors in the estimate","Market is pricing in lower growth than the company has historically delivered","Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount","Minimal goodwill on the balance sheet \u2014 low impairment risk","Consumer Cyclical sector outperforming the broader market over the past quarter"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Red Rock Resorts (NASDAQ:RRR) Posts Earnings Results, Misses Expectations By $0.62 EPS","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/05/red-rock-resorts-nasdaqrrr-posts-earnings-results-misses-expectations-by-0-62-eps.html","date":"2026-11-05","timestamp":1793887975.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.34,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Red Rock Resorts (NASDAQ:RRR) Stock Price Target Cut by JPMorgan Chase & Co.","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/04/red-rock-resorts-nasdaqrrr-stock-price-target-cut-by-jpmorgan-chase-co.html","date":"2026-11-04","timestamp":1793825327.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.296,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["analyst_action"]},{"title":"Red Rock Resorts (RRR) Q3 2026 Earnings Call Transcript","source":"aol.com","link":"https://www.aol.com/articles/red-rock-resorts-rrr-q3-152938000.html","date":"2026-11-04","timestamp":1793807047.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.477,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Red Rock Resorts declares $0.26 dividend (NASDAQ:RRR)","source":"seekingalpha.com","link":"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4664707-red-rock-resorts-declares-0_26-dividend","date":"2026-11-04","timestamp":1793796577.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["dividend"]},{"title":"RRR Q3 2026 deep dive: margin pressure and project delays weigh on outlook","source":"stockstory.org","link":"https://stockstory.org/us/stocks/nasdaq/rrr/news/earnings-call/rrr-q3-2026-deep-dive-margin-pressure-and-project-delays-weigh-on-outlook","date":"2026-11-04","timestamp":1793770716.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.153,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings","guidance"]},{"title":"Red Rock anticipates Durango North opening in Q3 2027 with $430M investment targeting 20% ROI (NASDAQ:RRR)","source":"seekingalpha.com","link":"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4664462-red-rock-anticipates-durango-north-opening-in-q3-2027-with-430m-investment-targeting-20","date":"2026-11-04","timestamp":1793770045.0,"origin":"